{"id":"5caf5b54bcc1111e","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-cor-yoneda-embedding.md","title":"Yoneda Embedding","display":"cor-yoneda-embedding — Yoneda Embedding","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-yoneda-embedding","aliases":["58-cor-yoneda-embedding"],"display":"cor-yoneda-embedding — Yoneda Embedding","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-thm-yoneda.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-presheaf.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-yoneda-embedding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-yoneda-embedding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-yoneda-embedding — Yoneda Embedding"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca227784015c4bc0\" href=\"?note=ca227784015c4bc0\" title=\"../batch17/58-thm-yoneda.md\">../batch17/58-thm-yoneda.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8876d83b2589a917\" href=\"?note=8876d83b2589a917\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-presheaf.md\">../batch13/58-df-presheaf.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-functor.md\">../batch18/58-df-functor.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md\">../batch18/58-df-bijective.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> (set-coded category), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P=[\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathsf{Set}]\">\\(\\mathcal P=[\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathsf{Set}]\\)</span> (its presheaf category)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y=\\langle y_0,y_1\\rangle:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal P\">\\(y=\\langle y_0,y_1\\rangle:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal P\\)</span> (Yoneda functor)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Category}_S,\\mathrm{Functor}_S,\\mathrm{Bijective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Category}_S,\\mathrm{Functor}_S,\\mathrm{Bijective}\\)</span> (predicates from dependencies)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}yoneda\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathcal P=[\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathsf{Set}]\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(y,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal P)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall c\\in\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\bigl(y_0(c)=\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(-,c)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(a,b)\\;\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,a)\\;\n\\bigl((y_1(f))_X(g)=f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}g\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\forall a,b\\in\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n\\mathrm{Bijective}\\!\\left(y_1\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(a,b),\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(a,b),\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal P}(y_0(a),y_0(b))\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}yoneda\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathcal P=[\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathsf{Set}]\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(y,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal P)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall c\\in\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\bigl(y_0(c)=\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(-,c)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(a,b)\\;\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,a)\\;\n\\bigl((y_1(f))_X(g)=f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}g\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\forall a,b\\in\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n\\mathrm{Bijective}\\!\\left(y_1\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(a,b),\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(a,b),\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal P}(y_0(a),y_0(b))\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The statement is a corollary, not a definition of a fresh “fully faithful” predicate. Both the object and morphism actions of the Yoneda functor are bound explicitly before bijectivity is asserted.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-thm-yoneda.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca227784015c4bc0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-thm-yoneda.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-presheaf.md","status":"resolved","id":"8876d83b2589a917","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-presheaf.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-functor.md","status":"resolved","id":"877f1061e295cf5f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P=[\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathsf{Set}]","display":false},{"tex":"y=\\langle y_0,y_1\\rangle:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Category}_S,\\mathrm{Functor}_S,\\mathrm{Bijective}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}yoneda\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathcal P=[\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathsf{Set}]\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(y,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal P)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall c\\in\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\bigl(y_0(c)=\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(-,c)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(a,b)\\;\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,a)\\;\n\\bigl((y_1(f))_X(g)=f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}g\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\to\\forall a,b\\in\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n\\mathrm{Bijective}\\!\\left(y_1\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(a,b),\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(a,b),\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal P}(y_0(a),y_0(b))\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1819,"backlinks":[{"id":"3892a4c1e6888919","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$Y$ records the arrow action $f\\mapsto(g\\mapsto f\\circ g)$.  The final family of bijections is precisely full faithfulness; its surjectivity is the Yoneda lemma from [[58-cor-yoneda-embedding]]."},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-93","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-cor-yoneda-embedding.md|58-cor-yoneda-embedding]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["ca227784015c4bc0","8876d83b2589a917","877f1061e295cf5f","a87b7e1119b63b2c","d583890235faf0d5"]}